Securing Cloud Infrastructure (Azure)
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Configure Azure Network Security Groups (NSG) using Terraform for infrastructure as code
Implement automated Azure resource auditing using Python scripts
Perform comprehensive security assessments using Lynis on cloud infrastructure
Apply security best practices for Azure cloud environments
Understand continuous security monitoring in cloud deployments
Prerequisites
Basic understanding of cloud computing and networking concepts
Familiarity with Linux command line operations
Basic Python programming knowledge
Understanding of Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles
Basic knowledge of security principles
