Task 3: Perform Security Assessment with Lynis
Step 3.1: Verify Lynis Installation
# Check Lynis version
lynis show version

# Update Lynis database
sudo lynis update info

# View available tests
lynis show groups
Step 3.2: Run System Security Audit
# Create reports directory
mkdir -p ~/azure-security-lab/lynis-reports
cd ~/azure-security-lab/lynis-reports

# Run comprehensive system audit
sudo lynis audit system --verbose --log-file lynis-system-audit.log

# View audit report
sudo lynis show report

# Check specific security areas
sudo lynis show details
Step 3.3: Analyze Lynis Results
